# Google sign-in (frontend). Without it the access screen only offers the local profile.
# Create an OAuth 2.0 Web client at https://console.cloud.google.com/apis/credentials and add the
# origins you use under "Authorized JavaScript origins" (dev server: http://localhost:3000).
VITE_GOOGLE_CLIENT_ID=

# Server-side only: read by the invoice-reading proxy (server/, plugins/ai-proxy.js, api/extract-invoice.js).
# Get one at https://aistudio.google.com/apikey. NEVER prefix it with VITE_: that would bundle it into the browser.
# Restart the dev server after editing this file (npm run dev).
GEMINI_API_KEY=
# Optional: override the model (default: gemini-flash-lite-latest, falling back to gemini-flash-latest).
# GEMINI_MODEL=
